- assets/logo-icon.svg
- assets/hammerhead-style.css

The following upstream files have been modified for this repository:

- .gitignore: adapts ignored generated files and retains the Pint test-boundary document.
- build.gradle.kts: removes unused sample-project plugins from the standalone application build.
- gradle/libs.versions.toml: removes unused sample dependencies and records Pint dependencies.
- settings.gradle.kts: selects the Pint application module and removes upstream package feeds.
- README.md: replaces generic SDK documentation with Pint Progress application documentation.
- lib/build.gradle.kts: removes the upstream Maven publication configuration and its GitHub
  Packages credential path.
- lib/src/main/kotlin/io/hammerhead/karooext/extension/KarooExtension.kt: adds caller gating,
  bounded session registration, safe view-config parsing, and teardown cancellation.
- lib/src/main/kotlin/io/hammerhead/karooext/internal/Consumer.kt: rejects malformed serialized
  event bundles without logging their contents.
- lib/src/main/kotlin/io/hammerhead/karooext/internal/Emitter.kt: makes cancellation safe when a
  host stops a session while it is starting.
- gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties: pins the official Gradle distribution checksum.
